WEBVTT

00:11:27.833 --> 00:11:30.101
at the individual level,
at the community level

00:11:30.125 --> 00:11:31.476
and at the business level.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:34.684
It's important to our families,
it's important to our communities

00:11:34.708 --> 00:11:37.268
and it's important to our economy.

00:11:37.292 --> 00:11:40.184
Instead of talking about
how the gap continues to grow,

00:11:40.208 --> 00:11:42.476
let's begin to close the gap now.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.000
Thank you.